{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43957","headline":"绣龟形诗 · 侯氏","name":"绣龟形诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暌离已是十秋强，对镜那堪重理妆。\n闻鴈几回修尺素，见霜先爲制衣裳。\n开箱叠练先垂泪，拂杵调砧更断肠。\n绣作龟形献天子，愿教征客早还乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"侯氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43957.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43957","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}